rries its parse diagnostic; the omitted "no diagnostics" line follows `DiagnosticsPanel`'s own documented position that an empty list means there is nothing to say at this spot, with the Save button's enabled state as the editor's all-clear signal. Decision 8 rests on where profiles are authored: a second create entry point in another view means a nav switch plus a create for the same action, and spec 8.3 asks views to carry small inline explanations where a first-time user would otherwise guess - which a sentence does and a button does not.
 
